      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "A truck bomb exploded near a military base in Planadas, Tolima Department, Colombia, killing four people, including a baby, and wounding several others.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-02:7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:09Z",
      "text": "The Colombian conflict began on May 27, 1964, and is described as a low-intensity asymmetric war involving the government, paramilitary groups, crime syndicates, and far-left guerrilla groups.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383713402:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:18Z",
      "text": "The events are located on the map in Tolima Department, Colombia, where the reports place them.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-02:7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:26Z",
      "text": "The two sides are cartels and paramilitaries, including La Oficina (1993) and Clan del Golfo (2001), and rebel groups, including FARC dissidents (2016) and CGSB (1987–1990).",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1383713402:side-1",
        "wiki:box:1383713402:side-2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "As the article records its status, the conflict is ongoing, with a Colombia–FARC peace deal in 2016 and the start of the Catatumbo campaign in 2018.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1383713402:status"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:40Z",
      "text": "According to the article's figures, side 1 casualties include 4,908 killed and 20,001 injured since 2004, while side 2 figures include 2,200 killed and 35,000 demobilized.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1383713402:casualties-side-1-",
        "wiki:box:1383713402:casualties-side-2-"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:49Z",
      "text": "Colombia is also named in the reports.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-02:7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:58Z",
      "text": "The event was reported by BBC News and Reuters.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-02:7"
      ]
    }
